      "page": 1,
      "text": "Do"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Agh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "That was..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SFX: Screech"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Just a rat."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Sheesh, that scared me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "come to think of it..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...there are quite a few..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "RAT TRAPS..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yes, there are a lot of rats."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I hate them, really."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Why don't you get..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A cat?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A cat?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That would make sense, but..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "They say some of the people here don't like cats, so..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ah..."
    }
